  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 510.06 Investment in National Credit Union Central Liquidity Facility. A credit union may invest in shares or deposits of any central liquidity facility in which such investments are specifically authorized by the board of directors of the credit union making the investment.\n\nSource. #2120, eff 8-12-82, became EXEMPT from expiration pursuant to 1983, 287:2, eff 6-18-83",
